  timesOfDay:
  - name: Dawn
    hour: 6.4
    chance: 10
    lootMultiplier: 1.05
    enemyDensity: 0.85
    briefing: Mist lies on the pools and the cotton grass is wet. The dead are going back into the water as the light comes.
    skyCover: 0.4
  - name: Day
    hour: 11
    chance: 55
    lootMultiplier: 1
    enemyDensity: 1
    briefing: Open sky over the moor, the first in a long while. You can see a long way across the fen, and so can the things on the wing.
    skyCover: 0.5
  - name: Dusk
    hour: 19.4
    chance: 25
    lootMultiplier: 1.15
    enemyDensity: 1.15
    briefing: The mist starts to dance over the pools and the dead stir in the peat. A rider in rotten mail walks the far bank.
    skyCover: 0.4
  - name: Night
    hour: 23.5
    chance: 10
    lootMultiplier: 1.4
    enemyDensity: 1.3
    briefing: 'Lights over the water, and the fen gives up its dead: more of them, and stronger. They carry twice the Cursed Essence.'
    skyCover: 0.3
